# Documentation-only placeholders: never fill this tracked file with a real
# credential and never copy a company .env to a personal computer. Inject a
# key that remains authorized after the move into the current process with
# hidden input or a personal secret broker; persist only provider/model selections.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# ASTERCODE_MODEL_PROVIDER=deepseek
# ASTERCODE_MODEL_ID=
# ASTERCODE_REASONING_EFFORT=max
